    },
    {
      "unique_index": 3,
      "cn_text": "格瓦拉也是把游击战法理论化的人之一。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 54,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_ADDS_FIRST_IGNORED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 4,
      "cn_text": "还有人称“阿拉伯的劳伦斯”的T．E．劳伦斯少校。以及写过《游击战》的毛泽东……",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 113,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_TITLE_CONFLICT_JPN_USED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 5,
      "cn_text": "先不谈理论，尼加拉瓜的桑地诺将军也是采用游击战法的人之一。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 87,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_REFERENCE_CLIPPED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 6,
      "cn_text": "难怪<R=FSLN,サンディニスタ>会以他命名。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "<R=FSLN,サンディニスタ>",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 54,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_PRESERVED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 7,
      "cn_text": "不过，游击战本身自古就存在。毕竟少数人要扰乱大军，能用的手段就那么几种。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 108,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 8,
      "cn_text": "日本也有过擅长游击战的武士。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
